nt }_{0}^{\\infty }\\frac{{e}^{-t}}{{t}^{1-z}}\\,\\text{d}t$ matches the definition:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }\\frac{{e}^{-t}}{{t}^{1-z}}={\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }{t}^{z-1}{e}^{-t}\\,\\text{d}t=Γ(z)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- Integral ${\\int }_{-1}^{\\infty }{t}^{z-1}{e}^{-t}\\,\\text{d}t$ does *not* match the definition. The lower bound of integration does not match that given in the definition.\n\n- Integral ${\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }{t}^{z-1}{e}^{t}\\,\\text{d}t$ does *not* match the definition. The integrand ${t}^{z-1}{e}^{t}$ is not equivalent to that shown in the definition.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is ${\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }\\frac{{e}^{-t}}{{t}^{1-z}}\\,\\text{d}t$ only."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186432693 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186172066 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "7e75041c-d0be-5db2-a0db-7c2c2b57b44e" :knowledge-point/title "Defining the Gamma Function"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "5b2b758f-75d7-5c78-bc71-8078b25bee7b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474218} {:answer/id #uuid "21ebef7c-543a-58db-9cc0-9d12cd347cfa" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474219}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "5b2b758f-75d7-5c78-bc71-8078b25bee7b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474218} :answer-field/id #uuid "236196c6-aac6-5df3-862a-cb71789484c7" :answer-field/key "${\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }\\frac{{e}^{t}}{{t}^{z-1}}\\,\\text{d}t$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186475035} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "fc1ad021-9c3d-5661-8fc7-8dce44bee41c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474220} {:answer/id #uuid "85e445cf-3a6d-51fe-adbc-9f0c0f3e8cd9" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474221}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "85e445cf-3a6d-51fe-adbc-9f0c0f3e8cd9" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474221} :answer-field/id #uuid "5358d2d4-3556-563f-99e6-7e5db3f114d2" :answer-field/key "${\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }\\frac{{t}^{z}}{t{e}^{t}}\\,\\text{d}t$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186475036} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "cb1e52e5-5b65-5f8c-8094-c0f68f056b7c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474222} {:answer/id #uuid "fb406fc8-b499-5aef-8cca-5838a92c582f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474223}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "fb406fc8-b499-5aef-8cca-5838a92c582f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474223} :answer-field/id #uuid "84e40a74-22fd-518e-8c1a-b247366725e4" :answer-field/key "${\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }{t}^{z-1}{e}^{-t}\\,\\text{d}t$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186475037}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "8aae46a7-7405-5484-9202-26c3555ea95d" :question/math-academy-id "q-107832" :question/problem "Which of the following integrals are equivalent to $Γ(z)$ for $\\text{Re}(z)>0?$\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "First, let's recall the definition of the gamma function:\n\n$$\nΓ(z)={\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }{t}^{z-1}{e}^{-t}\\,\\text{d}t,\\,\\text{Re}(z)>0.\n$$\n\nWith this definition in mind, let's consider each of the given integrals.\n\n- Integral ${\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }\\frac{{e}^{t}}{{t}^{z-1}}\\,\\text{d}t$ does *not* match the definition. The integrand $\\frac{{e}^{t}}{{t}^{z-1}}$ is not equivalent to that shown in the definition.\n\n- Integral ${\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }\\frac{{t}^{z}}{t{e}^{t}}\\,\\text{d}t$ matches the definition:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }\\frac{{t}^{z}}{t{e}^{t}}\\,\\text{d}t={\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }{t}^{z-1}{e}^{-t}\\,\\text{d}t=Γ(z)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- Integral ${\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }{t}^{z-1}{e}^{-t}\\,\\text{d}t$ matches the definition:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }{t}^{z-1}{e}^{-t}\\,\\text{d}t=Γ(z)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is ${\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }\\frac{{t}^{z}}{t{e}^{t}}\\,\\text{d}t$; ${\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }{t}^{z-1}{e}^{-t}\\,\\text{d}t$ only."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186432698 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186172066 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "7e75041c-d0be-5db2-a0db-7c2c2b57b44e" :knowledge-point/title "Defining the Gamma Function"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "ef308e06-992f-56cb-a814-cd6e2eabff6f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474230} {:answer/id #uuid "2b21cf5a-1e34-520e-9b32-cc50912a07a5" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474231}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "2b21cf5a-1e34-520e-9b32-cc50912a07a5" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474231} :answer-field/id #uuid "ecb6fb3d-cd96-5eec-a8eb-ac08a291bda7" :answer-field/key "$3{\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }\\frac{{t}^{3z-1}}{{e}^{{t}^{3}}}\\,\\text{d}t$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186475041} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "c8347029-3c1b-5125-804b-ccf6172e683c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474232} {:answer/id #uuid "32c4c54c-28fd-5f78-b386-af8e7132a6d8" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474233}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "c8347029-3c1b-5125-804b-ccf6172e683c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474232} :answer-field/id #uuid "4639a250-d5bb-53ed-ad1e-c39f6e96a9dd" :answer-field/key "$3{\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }{t}^{3z-3}{e}^{-{t}^{3}}\\,\\text{d}t$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186475042} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "078bdafd-6fe4-5612-9cda-fdc4bf25bdd6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474234} {:answer/id #uuid "a38e3e27-dc42-59fe-ab1d-da94d35d596d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474235}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "078bdafd-6fe4-5612-9cda-fdc4bf25bdd6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474234} :answer-field/id #uuid "c352f108-be80-5fd3-9710-17251641c6d4" :answer-field/key "$3{\\int }_{1}^{\\infty }{t}^{3z-1}{e}^{-t}\\,\\text{d}t$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186475043}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "ef7933ca-459a-5897-8c5b-5b08b877b68b" :question/math-academy-id "q-107838" :question/problem "Which of the following integrals are equivalent to $Γ(z)$ for $\\text{Re}(z)>0?$\n\nSelect all that apply. If none apply, leave all boxes unchecked." :question/worked-solution "First, let's recall the definition of the gamma function:\n\n$$\nΓ(z)={\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }{t}^{z-1}{e}^{-t}\\,\\text{d}t,\\,\\text{Re}(z)>0.\n$$\n\nWith this definition in mind, let's consider each of the given integrals.\n\n- Integral $3{\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }\\frac{{t}^{3z-1}}{{e}^{{t}^{3}}}\\,\\text{d}t$ matches the definition. We use a substitution $s={t}^{3},$ then $3{t}^{2}\\,\\text{d}t=\\text{d}s.$ We get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3{\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }{t}^{3z-1}{e}^{-{t}^{3}}\\,\\text{d}t & =3{\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }{t}^{3(z-1)+2}{e}^{-{t}^{3}}\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }{t}^{3(z-1)}{e}^{-{t}^{3}}(3{t}^{2})\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }{s}^{z-1}{e}^{-s}\\,\\text{d}s=Γ(z).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- Integral $3{\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }{t}^{3z-3}{e}^{-{t}^{3}}\\,\\text{d}t$ does *not* match the definition. The integrand ${t}^{3z-3}{e}^{-{t}^{3}}$ is not equivalent to that shown in the definition.\n\n- Integral $3{\\int }_{1}^{\\infty }{t}^{3z-1}{e}^{-t}\\,\\text{d}t$ does *not* match the definition. The lower bound of integration does not match that given in the definition.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is $3{\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }\\frac{{t}^{3z-1}}{{e}^{{t}^{3}}}\\,\\text{d}t$ only."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186432784 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186171934 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "cb0ae539-5348-5a2c-b226-c009ce6d6094" :knowledge-point/title "Determining if a Number Is Divisible by 7"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "acaddc19-71fe-529b-8270-6f2e695f41b5" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474744} {:answer/id #uuid "84d5ffe0-a191-5c87-8484-bec5589dd610" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474745}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "acaddc19-71fe-529b-8270-6f2e695f41b5" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474744} :answer-field/id #uuid "43abff9b-0dbf-5577-9f83-67a65cc9c6a2" :answer-field/key "The number $276$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186475298} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "dc465029-e1fb-538b-8e85-d0174018e3e0" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474746} {:answer/id #uuid "019ee61a-4561-5588-afaa-c8b3bb41b5e5" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474747}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "dc465029-e1fb-538b-8e85-d0174018e3e0" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474746} :answer-field/id #uuid "60401644-f161-55b8-b551-e1e80727b7b1" :answer-field/key "The number $647$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186475299} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "580e8f79-6065-595a-a43f-e10b2f42fa9a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474748} {:answer/id #uuid "e50b94ef-8b70-56f2-a2da-c456b23eb5bc" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474749}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "e50b94ef-8b70-56f2-a2da-c456b23eb5bc" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474749} :answer-field/id #uuid "d9f52a68-17c6-56ae-9df0-1ffe6b9d370b" :answer-field/key "The number $805$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186475300}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "1d92850b-bd66-52a9-a628-fb23ae6c0162" :question/math-academy-id "q-223458" :question/problem "Which of the following numbers are divisible by $7?$\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "To check if a number is divisible by $7,$ double the last digit, subtract the result from the remaining digits, and then check if the difference is divisible by $7.$\n\n- For the number $276,$ we have that \n\n$$\n27-2(6)=27-12=15\n$$\n\nwhich is not divisible by $7.$ Therefore, $276$ is not divisible by $7.$\n\n- For the number $647,$ we have that \n\n$$\n64-2(7)=64-14=50\n$$\n\nwhich is not divisible by $7.$ Therefore, $647$ is not divisible by $7.$\n\n- For the number $805,$ we have that \n\n$$\n80-2(5)=80-10=70\n$$\n\nwhich is divisible by $7.$ Therefore, $805$ is divisible by $7.$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is “The number $805$” only."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186432785 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186171933 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "b483f9f7-47a9-5725-b1f1-fe0ea39a7e96" :knowledge-point/title "Determining if a Number Is Divisible by 6"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "3b3a1c18-402a-5826-bf79-0dba558c64fc" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474332} {:answer/id #uuid "6c88f31b-1b8f-5242-b277-9bc33fcc1d53" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474333}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "6c88f31b-1b8f-5242-b277-9bc33fcc1d53" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474333} :answer-field/id #uuid "bc5edc77-177d-5283-b4ed-f6d29e6130f3" :answer-field/key "$185\\,346$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186475092} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "3717d0fa-e38b-5a2c-bc8b-96a33d55cf5a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474334} {:answer/id #uuid "a0899615-a369-5445-bb33-8c945624b783" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474335}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "a0899615-a369-5445-bb33-8c945624b783" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474335} :answer-field/id #uuid "c5341e31-a447-5b11-b208-298c154fcdea" :answer-field/key "$2\\,525\\,934$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186475093} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "16a85a5c-42ba-5e88-a569-6fb4ddc389eb" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474336} {:answer/id #uuid "14c3560a-8a2d-5432-9a2c-f7b3ac672b40" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474337}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "14c3560a-8a2d-5432-9a2c-f7b3ac672b40" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474337} :answer-field/id #uuid "5d54dde0-4790-50de-af67-f644fa4e8182" :answer-field/key "$15\\,070\\,962$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186475094}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "245a9f1f-3fc0-594c-a273-205b94f4bf02" :question/math-academy-id "q-132405" :question/problem "Which of the following numbers are divisible by $6?$\n\nSelect all that apply. If none apply, leave all boxes unchecked." :question/worked-solution "A number is divisible by $6$ if it is divisible by both $2$ and $3.$\n\n- The number $185\\,346$ is divisible by $2,$ and it is also divisible by $3$ since the sum of its digits is divisible by $3:$\n\n$$\n1+8+5+3+4+6=27\n$$\n\nSo, $185\\,346$ is divisible by $6.$\n\n- The number $2\\,525\\,934$ is divisible by $2,$ and it is also divisible by $3$ since the sum of its digits is divisible by $3:$\n\n$$\n2+5+2+5+9+3+4=30\n$$\n\nSo, $2\\,525\\,934$ is divisible by $6.$\n\n- The number $15\\,070\\,962$ is divisible by $2,$ and it is also divisible by $3$ since the sum of its digits is divisible by $3:$\n\n$$\n1+5+0+7+0+9+6+2=30\n$$\n\nSo, $15\\,070\\,962$ is divisible by $6.$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is $185\\,346$; $2\\,525\\,934$; $15\\,070\\,962$."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186432786 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186171933 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "b483f9f7-47a9-5725-b1f1-fe0ea39a7e96" :knowledge-point/title "Determining if a Number Is Divisible by 6"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "254557ba-2300-5e8d-8010-4da154a091bd" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474936} {:answer/id #uuid "b4509af3-bd91-52d8-b845-f39459c6431f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474937}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "254557ba-2300-5e8d-8010-4da154a091bd" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474936} :answer-field/id #uuid "d5117c5c-0b3d-5681-bea7-e78fbc4dca15" :answer-field/key "The digit $2$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 175921864753