 number is divisible by $6$ if it is divisible by both $2$ and $3.$ Remember that to determine whether a number is divisible by $3,$ we check whether the sum of the digits is divisible by $3.$\n\nFor the given number, the sum of the digits is\n\n$$\n5+9+1+0+3+0+4+7+◻=29+◻.\n$$\n\nNow, let's consider each of the given digits we can substitute into the blank.\n\n- If we substitute $2$ into the blank, we get $591\\,030\\,472,$ which is divisible by $2.$ However, it is not divisible by $3$ because the sum of the digits is $29+2=31,$ which is not divisible by $3.$ So, the number is *not* divisible by $6$ either.\n\n- If we substitute $5$ into the blank, we get $591\\,030\\,475,$ which is not divisible by $2,$ so it is not divisible by $6$ either.\n\n- If we substitute $4$ into the blank, we get $591\\,030\\,474,$ which is divisible by $2.$ The sum of the digits is $29+4=33,$ so the number is also divisible by $3.$ Therefore, the number is divisible by $6.$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is “The digit $4$” only."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186432787 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186171934 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "cb0ae539-5348-5a2c-b226-c009ce6d6094" :knowledge-point/title "Determining if a Number Is Divisible by 7"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "297df35f-e065-50a4-a888-680ae0d69b1b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474732} {:answer/id #uuid "aa96fa2f-53e6-5a3c-a179-ee3fb5c6cfbf" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474733}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "aa96fa2f-53e6-5a3c-a179-ee3fb5c6cfbf" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474733} :answer-field/id #uuid "d5282cdc-0784-5534-92bc-f6b79006d949" :answer-field/key "The number $434$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186475292} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "e105e232-7b31-5374-8bbb-3fface90df32" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474734} {:answer/id #uuid "65a97dbd-f8ff-57ae-a2dd-21160d5cd783" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474735}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "e105e232-7b31-5374-8bbb-3fface90df32" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474734} :answer-field/id #uuid "ce78228c-506d-51cc-af6c-7bb332d49800" :answer-field/key "The number $785$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186475293} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "840e138b-34dd-5430-8842-ed13b7bb18b6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474736} {:answer/id #uuid "21f4d4a0-12cf-5ea3-bfae-ec8a74f56745" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474737}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "840e138b-34dd-5430-8842-ed13b7bb18b6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474736} :answer-field/id #uuid "a94010a1-4686-5e5c-9995-109721e74235" :answer-field/key "The number $587$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186475294}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "6daa78eb-7b75-5f11-9d14-72a95f4ad0c2" :question/math-academy-id "q-223454" :question/problem "Which of the following numbers are divisible by $7?$\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "To check if a number is divisible by $7,$ double the last digit, subtract the result from the remaining digits, and then check if the difference is divisible by $7.$\n\n- For the number $434,$ we have that \n\n$$\n43-2(4)=43-8=35\n$$\n\nwhich is divisible by $7.$ Therefore, $434$ is divisible by $7.$\n\n- For the number $785,$ we have that \n\n$$\n78-2(5)=78-10=68\n$$\n\nwhich is not divisible by $7.$ Therefore, $785$ is not divisible by $7.$\n\n- For the number $587,$ we have that \n\n$$\n58-2(7)=58-14=44\n$$\n\nwhich is not divisible by $7.$ Therefore, $587$ is not divisible by $7.$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is “The number $434$” only."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186432788 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186171932 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "fb8fa39c-a982-569a-b2e0-833c51259711" :knowledge-point/title "Determining if a Number Is Divisible by 3 or 9"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1351f483-9f6f-5ca4-b59a-96f2a4ac3b38" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474924} {:answer/id #uuid "c8c6b0c8-d254-5938-9bfa-fe702324cad1" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474925}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "1351f483-9f6f-5ca4-b59a-96f2a4ac3b38" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474924} :answer-field/id #uuid "71daca45-fa65-5f59-84d9-6e9b687f8102" :answer-field/key "The digit $4$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186475388} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "5e5681a9-b8f2-57ea-a045-8f0e6480c7d7" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474926} {:answer/id #uuid "14cc714a-b43d-5803-8b3d-772c5a4cbceb" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474927}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "14cc714a-b43d-5803-8b3d-772c5a4cbceb" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474927} :answer-field/id #uuid "ae0f5497-0e93-55e4-b788-999e4862d7cd" :answer-field/key "The digit $6$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186475389} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "8ac4220b-5a8e-5a5c-a33e-c22b9e38166a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474928} {:answer/id #uuid "5277ca62-ffeb-5943-b154-faaeaa05e0ff" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474929}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "8ac4220b-5a8e-5a5c-a33e-c22b9e38166a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474928} :answer-field/id #uuid "d56d98b5-10f1-596d-b044-de294d5645cb" :answer-field/key "The digit $9$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186475390}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "7d8254ce-5d00-53a5-a718-295062329804" :question/math-academy-id "q-85144" :question/problem "Which digits, when inserted into the blank, make the number $173\\,◻32\\,338$ divisible by $9?$\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "A number is divisible by $9$ if the sum of its digits is divisible by $9.$\n\nFor the number $173\\,◻32\\,338\\,$ the sum of the digits is\n\n$$\n1+7+3+◻+3+2+3+3+8=30+◻.\n$$\n\nNow, let's consider each of the given digits that could be inserted into the blank.\n\n- If we insert $4$ into the blank, then the sum of the digits is $30+4=34,$ which is *not* divisible by $9.$\n\n- If we insert $6$ into the blank, then the sum of the digits is $30+6=36,$ which is divisible by $9.$\n\n- If we insert $9$ into the blank, then the sum of the digits is $30+9=39,$ which is *not* divisible by $9.$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is “The digit $6$” only."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186432789 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186171933 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "b483f9f7-47a9-5725-b1f1-fe0ea39a7e96" :knowledge-point/title "Determining if a Number Is Divisible by 6"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "9060c880-173b-56eb-8b5c-f207d11000e5" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474338} {:answer/id #uuid "2baed584-6766-5727-b4d5-755a33a351a0" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474339}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "9060c880-173b-56eb-8b5c-f207d11000e5" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474338} :answer-field/id #uuid "5699c1fc-bbd9-5f32-999a-f7483dbb6a4b" :answer-field/key "$345\\,989\\,191$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186475095} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "54faa10a-47a7-590a-9bda-8760e7720749" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474340} {:answer/id #uuid "a3f5e6c7-259d-542f-a72b-425b0a9ed3ef" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474341}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "a3f5e6c7-259d-542f-a72b-425b0a9ed3ef" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474341} :answer-field/id #uuid "71bcc6c2-e9cf-53c2-b8a9-413d5d326d53" :answer-field/key "$55\\,355\\,676$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186475096} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "271250c7-934d-5857-a55a-ba887c7a0799" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474342} {:answer/id #uuid "287f4083-2e5a-50b0-9588-6dfa85ee4d0d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474343}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "287f4083-2e5a-50b0-9588-6dfa85ee4d0d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474343} :answer-field/id #uuid "1a8b1725-7bd5-5770-985e-de9259016eb8" :answer-field/key "$137\\,252\\,124$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186475097}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "91c8241d-8043-5a59-abeb-68e020936dc7" :question/math-academy-id "q-132408" :question/problem "Which of the following numbers are divisible by $6?$\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "A number is divisible by $6$ if it is divisible by both $2$ and $3.$\n\n- The number $345\\,989\\,191$ is not divisible by $2,$ so it is not divisible by $6.$\n\n- The number $55\\,355\\,676$ is divisible by $2,$ and it is also divisible by $3$ since the sum of its digits is divisible by $3:$\n\n$$\n5+5+3+5+5+6+7+6=42\n$$\n\nSo, $55\\,355\\,676$ is divisible by $6.$\n\n- The number $137\\,252\\,124$ is divisible by $2,$ and it is also divisible by $3$ since the sum of its digits is divisible by $3:$\n\n$$\n1+3+7+2+5+2+1+2+4=27\n$$\n\nSo, $137\\,252\\,124$ is divisible by $6.$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is $55\\,355\\,676$; $137\\,252\\,124$ only."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186432790 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186171934 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "cb0ae539-5348-5a2c-b226-c009ce6d6094" :knowledge-point/title "Determining if a Number Is Divisible by 7"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "16038b37-fb72-5b4d-a1b9-61faa977017a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474726} {:answer/id #uuid "03bd83fe-2bc5-50c4-8f9c-c0f326589f2f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474727}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "16038b37-fb72-5b4d-a1b9-61faa977017a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474726} :answer-field/id #uuid "3c2069b5-74fd-5c33-940d-8d4fbd791f49" :answer-field/key "The number $447$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186475289} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "e7db56f2-47af-5474-9afc-f735b48ad580" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474728} {:answer/id #uuid "ba5b14e6-0fd7-5cef-90c2-621c945bb93b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474729}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "ba5b14e6-0fd7-5cef-90c2-621c945bb93b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474729} :answer-field/id #uuid "3bca8887-5b74-5643-8790-24799ecf6e6a" :answer-field/key "The number $406$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186475290} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "065f8e98-a07c-56e1-afb1-7e545dea83dd" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474730} {:answer/id #uuid "9a4f6b33-cec5-5deb-a6ed-98744c9c6629" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474731}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "9a4f6b33-cec5-5deb-a6ed-98744c9c6629" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474731} :answer-field/id #uuid "87baa62c-d591-522f-be89-ffc490230761" :answer-field/key "The number $847$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186475291}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "951452dc-b5fb-50d7-8d4f-8b1233b43cf0" :question/math-academy-id "q-223369" :question/problem "Which of the following numbers are divisible by $7?$\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "To check if a number is divisible by $7,$ double the last digit, subtract the result from the remaining digits, and then check if the difference is divisible by $7.$\n\n- For the number $447,$ we have that \n\n$$\n44-2(7)=44-14=30\n$$\n\nwhich is not divisible by $7.$ Therefore, $447$ is not divisible by $7.$\n\n- For the number $406,$ we have that \n\n$$\n40-2(6)=40-12=28\n$$\n\nwhich is divisible by $7.$ Therefore, $406$ is divisible by $7.$\n\n- For the number $847,$ we have that \n\n$$\n84-2(7)=84-14=70\n$$\n\nwhich is divisible by $7.$ Therefore, $847$ is divisible by $7.$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is “The number $406$”; “The number $847$” only."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186432791 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186171933 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "b483f9f7-47a9-5725-b1f1-fe0ea39a7e96" :knowledge-point/title "Determining if a Number Is Divisible by 6"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "656bfbd5-55fb-542c-a9af-9daf94d4db13" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474930} {:answer/id #uuid "c945e1c9-bb91-57da-a00c-3a0a64455f37" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474931}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "c945e1c9-bb91-57da-a00c-3a0a64455f37" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474931} :answer-field/id #uuid "505e2ac2-a385-5e64-8ab1-cb519dcd0b6b" :answer-field/key "The digit $0$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186475391} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "f5151017-f279-5948-acb5-ce0fcc865bad" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474932} {:answer/id #uuid "85cb6a3c-4a52-55d4-8f8f-daeb88d1748d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474933}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "f5151017-f279-5948-acb5-ce0fcc865bad" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474932} :answer-field/id #uuid "f04ba15f-4e06-5217-af4c-19c44b6a6a8b" :answer-field/key "The digit $5$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186475392} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "4dee975e-ca22-59f3-9552-3f9a8d1c78d3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474934} {:answer/id #uuid "7236dea6-94eb-5ef3-9285-34ff8e0444c1" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474935}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "7236dea6-94eb-5ef3-9285-34ff8e0444c1" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474935} :answer-field/id #uuid "bb8d1cfa-b24a-51a4-846e-e5c22847e924" :answer-field/key "The digit $6$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186475393}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "a49592c2-4649-5980-ab80-d5418f7e763f" :question/math-academy-id "q-85422" :question/problem "Which digits, when inserted into the blank, make the number $114\\,040\\,32◻$ divisible by $6?$\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "A number is divisible by $6$ if it is divisible by both $2$ and $3.$ Remember that to determine whether a number is divisible by $3,$ we check whether the sum of the digits is divisible by $3.$\n\nFor the given number, the sum of the digits is\n\n$$\n1+1+4+0+4+0+3+2+◻=15+◻.\n$$\n\nNow, let's consider each of the given digits we can substitute into the blank.\n\n- If we substitute $0$ into the blank, we get $114\\,040\\,320,$ which is divisible by $2.$ The sum of the digits is $15+0=15,$ which is divisible by $3,$ so the number is also divisible by $3.$ Therefore, the number is divisible by $6.$\n\n- If we substitute $5$ into the blank, we get $114\\,040\\,325,$ which is not divisible by $2.$ So, the number is *not* divisible by $6$ either.\n\n- If we substitute $6$ into the blank, we get $114\\,040\\,326,$ which is divisible by $2.$ The sum of the digits is $15+6=21,$ which is divisible by $3,$ so the number is also divisible by $3.$ Therefore, the number is divisible by $6.$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is “The digit $0$”; “The digit $6$” only."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186432793 :knowledge-poi