t} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474324} {:answer/id #uuid "91ad8e9e-37ad-5097-9f17-8d7924c4732b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474325}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "91ad8e9e-37ad-5097-9f17-8d7924c4732b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474325} :answer-field/id #uuid "cef549f3-e13e-5104-8ca9-934b1ad8e331" :answer-field/key "$12\\,144\\,801$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186475088}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "c9669189-f542-5fc7-9dce-62db6de9555d" :question/math-academy-id "q-132386" :question/problem "Which of the following numbers are divisible by $3?$\n\nSelect all that apply. If none apply, leave all boxes unchecked." :question/worked-solution "A number is divisible by $3$ if the sum of its digits is divisible by $3.$\n\n- The sum of the digits of $935\\,784$ is\n\n$$\n9+3+5+7+8+4=36,\n$$\n\nwhich is divisible by $3.$ So, $935\\,784$ is divisible by $3.$\n\n- The sum of the digits of $7\\,391\\,123$ is\n\n$$\n7+3+9+1+1+2+3=26,\n$$\n\nwhich is *not* divisible by $3.$ So, $7\\,391\\,123$ is *not* divisible by $3.$\n\n- The sum of the digits of $12\\,144\\,801$ is\n\n$$\n1+2+1+4+4+8+0+1=21,\n$$\n\nwhich is divisible by $3.$ So,  $12\\,144\\,801$ is divisible by $3.$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is $935\\,784$; $12\\,144\\,801$ only."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186432794 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186171932 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "fb8fa39c-a982-569a-b2e0-833c51259711" :knowledge-point/title "Determining if a Number Is Divisible by 3 or 9"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "80cddcd7-7a10-53d3-a249-589070851828" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 175921