answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474330} :answer-field/id #uuid "619d29e9-1652-56eb-a3ec-9f5d3d435236" :answer-field/key "$733\\,123$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186475091}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "e2757e05-6aab-58ae-aed8-77516507381e" :question/math-academy-id "q-132392" :question/problem "Which of the following numbers are divisible by $9?$\n\nSelect all that apply. If none apply, leave all boxes unchecked." :question/worked-solution "A number is divisible by $9$ if the sum of its digits is divisible by $9.$\n\n- The sum of the digits of $34\\,154\\,119$ is\n\n$$\n3+4+1+5+4+1+1+9=28,\n$$\n\nwhich is *not* divisible by $9.$ So, $34\\,154\\,119$ is *not* divisible by $9.$\n\n- The sum of the digits of $9\\,173\\,589$ is\n\n$$\n9+1+7+3+5+8+9=42,\n$$\n\nwhich is *not* divisible by $9.$ So, $9\\,173\\,589$ is *not* divisible by $9.$\n\n- The sum of the digits of $733\\,123$ is\n\n$$\n7+3+3+1+2+3=19,\n$$\n\nwhich is *not* divisible by $9.$ So, $733\\,123$ is *not* divisible by $9.$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"None.\""} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186432795 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186171934 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "cb0ae539-5348-5a2c-b226-c009ce6d6094" :knowledge-point/title "Determining if a Number Is Divisible by 7"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "01d64aae-b4bb-5dea-a20a-c665725ead2c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474720} {:answer/id #uuid "f191222d-9f7f-5024-a520-ff1d65b86880" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474721}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "f191222d-9f7f-5024-a520-ff1d65b86880" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474721} :answer-field/id #uuid "def74a04-8990-5db1-a5a1-8d1583c0ca04" :answer-field/key "The number $448$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186475286} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "5478d6ca-d740-542a-b41d-63ed73f5fefa" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474722} {:answer/id #uuid "6c1d51b2-5f4c-52ee-9581-31b9418eced1" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474723}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "5478d6ca-d740-542a-b41d-63ed73f5fefa" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474722} :answer-field/id #uuid "5df53844-a158-5d95-ab51-8edd45f16998" :answer-field/key "The number $352$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186475287} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "f9ceea81-d289-51c6-932d-fc71211851b0" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474724} {:answer/id #uuid "2d27c2f6-fd90-5b6b-bfdf-c5d81844d667" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474725}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "2d27c2f6-fd90-5b6b-bfdf-c5d81844d667" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474725} :answer-field/id #uuid "1a093a01-05c2-5489-916c-e7d8540f516c" :answer-field/key "The number $217$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186475288}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "f0e5ee54-f96c-54ab-8de5-f272c76ac6c8" :question/math-academy-id "q-223365" :question/problem "Which of the following numbers are divisible by $7?$\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "To check if a number is divisible by $7,$ double the last digit, subtract the result from the remaining digits, and then check if the difference is divisible by $7.$\n\n- For the number $448,$ we have that \n\n$$\n44-2(8)=44-16=28\n$$\n\nwhich is divisible by $7.$ Therefore, $448$ is divisible by $7.$\n\n- For the number $352,$ we have that \n\n$$\n35-2(2)=35-4=31\n$$\n\nwhich is not divisible by $7.$ Therefore, $352$ is not divisible by $7.$\n\n- For the number $217,$ we have that \n\n$$\n21-2(7)=21-14=7\n$$\n\nwhich is divisible by $7.$ Therefore, $217$ is divisible by $7.$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is “The number $448$”; “The number $217$” only."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186432796 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186171934 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "cb0ae539-5348-5a2c-b226-c009ce6d6094" :knowledge-point/title "Determining if a Number Is Divisible by 7"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "9121cec7-c707-581d-8d65-e6975e317841" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474738} {:answer/id #uuid "0909e94b-b592-5c37-a619-583ae74c0539" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474739}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "0909e94b-b592-5c37-a619-583ae74c0539" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474739} :answer-field/id #uuid "6b8f350f-5bf9-5e09-8c6d-de588c426ec7" :answer-field/key "The number $476$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186475295} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2b6a910b-9f47-5d8a-9683-5af9f80db49e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474740} {:answer/id #uuid "85ff6ebc-9322-5562-ad87-cff4785b7af3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474741}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "2b6a910b-9f47-5d8a-9683-5af9f80db49e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474740} :answer-field/id #uuid "6cf9f24e-a880-521b-98dd-b5f02cd8153f" :answer-field/key "The number $732$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186475296} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "616704c4-4aee-55fb-9182-8a572e841576" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474742} {:answer/id #uuid "51cdba76-b23a-5bdb-889e-d5d4d392eeca" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474743}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "616704c4-4aee-55fb-9182-8a572e841576" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474742} :answer-field/id #uuid "8a5b036b-3896-53dd-b6f5-b42db8a1fa95" :answer-field/key "The number $423$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186475297}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "fdf659d7-2ff6-5274-9913-97ffa0cf4e09" :question/math-academy-id "q-223456" :question/problem "Which of the following numbers are divisible by $7?$\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "To check if a number is divisible by $7,$ double the last digit, subtract the result from the remaining digits, and then check if the difference is divisible by $7.$\n\n- For the number $476,$ we have that \n\n$$\n47-2(6)=47-12=35\n$$\n\nwhich is divisible by $7.$ Therefore, $476$ is divisible by $7.$\n\n- For the number $732,$ we have that \n\n$$\n73-2(2)=73-4=69\n$$\n\nwhich is not divisible by $7.$ Therefore, $732$ is not divisible by $7.$\n\n- For the number $423,$ we have that \n\n$$\n42-2(3)=42-6=36\n$$\n\nwhich is not divisible by $7.$ Therefore, $423$ is not divisible by $7.$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is “The number $476$” only."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186432828 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186147445 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "089c1139-6e3a-5240-be03-fb7e54ecbd7c" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying Types of Damped Oscillations"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "481847cc-0264-52cb-8b61-39a195b0a856" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186454132} {:answer/id #uuid "fe5bf668-db61-5ca5-b1c7-e96cbeefc670" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186454133}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "481847cc-0264-52cb-8b61-39a195b0a856" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186454132} :answer-field/id #uuid "d24d9507-2eec-5980-8295-313f1c817743" :answer-field/key "${y}^{″}+8{y}^{′}+4y=0$ represents an oscillator undergoing critical damping" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186454816} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "69ace99c-7bb8-5a9f-81ee-48aed85d8d8a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186454134} {:answer/id #uuid "764222ed-f9b1-50f4-95bd-165c99b40fab" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186454135}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "764222ed-f9b1-50f4-95bd-165c99b40fab" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186454135} :answer-field/id #uuid "6b8570cb-bfe7-598a-af72-2dc6d8b819b3" :answer-field/key "${y}^{″}+4{y}^{′}+3y=0$ represents an oscillator undergoing heavy damping" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186454817} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "ff29d747-eaa4-56f2-a5f0-5ad5482a32af" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186454136} {:answer/id #uuid "aa19f9d8-dd66-510c-a32f-b1104c503852" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186454137}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "ff29d747-eaa4-56f2-a5f0-5ad5482a32af" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186454136} :answer-field/id #uuid "0d621417-e29b-5942-88b3-d4b0e7c08903" :answer-field/key "${y}^{″}+12{y}^{′}+36y=0$ represents an oscillator undergoing light damping" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186454818}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "9d285631-ec24-50a4-ab3c-c0601632cbad" :question/math-academy-id "q-94314" :question/problem "Which of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "Remember that, given the equation of a damped harmonic oscillator, the type of damping depends on the discriminant of the characteristic equation:\n\n- $D>0$ leads to heavy damping,\n\n- $D=0$ leads to critical damping, and\n\n- $D<0$ leads to light damping.\n\nWith that in mind, let's inspect each equation.\n\n- The differential equation ${y}^{″}+8{y}^{′}+4y$ represents the equation of damped harmonic motion. \nThe auxiliary equation for $\\lambda $ is\n\n$$\n{\\lambda }^{2}+8\\lambda +4=0.\n$$\n\nThe discriminant of this quadratic equation is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}D={8}^{2}-4(1)(4) & =48>0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThus, the given equation represents heavy damping, and so statement “${y}^{″}+8{y}^{′}+4y=0$ represents an oscillator undergoing critical damping” is false.\n\n- The differential equation ${y}^{″}+4{y}^{′}+3y=0$ represents the equation of damped harmonic motion. \nThe auxiliary equation for $\\lambda $ is\n\n$$\n{\\lambda }^{2}+4\\lambda +3=0.\n$$\n\nThe discriminant of this quadratic equation is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}D={4}^{2}-4(1)(3) & =4>0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThus, the given equation represents heavy damping, and so statement “${y}^{″}+4{y}^{′}+3y=0$ represents an oscillator undergoing heavy damping” is true.\n\n- The differential equation ${y}^{″}+12{y}^{′}+36y$ represents the equation of damped harmonic motion. \nThe auxiliary equation for $\\lambda $ is\n\n$$\n{\\lambda }^{2}+12\\lambda +36=0.\n$$\n\nThe discriminant of this quadratic equation is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}D={12}^{2}-4(1)(36) & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThus, the given equation represents critical damping, and so statement “${y}^{″}+12{y}^{′}+36y=0$ represents an oscillator undergoing light damping” is false.\n\nIn conclusion, the correct answer is “${y}^{″}+4{y}^{′}+3y=0$ represents an oscillator undergoing heavy damping” only."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186433150 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186133843 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "ee1838df-f1d6-5bc4-908c-b96e2ad577c9" :knowledge-point/title "Determining Whether Sets are Orthogonal"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uu